2:T41e,{"@context":"https:\u002F\u002Fschema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.artisan.co\u002Fblog\u002Flead-generation-pricing#article","headline":"The ultimate guide to lead generation pricing for high ROI","name":"The ultimate guide to lead generation pricing for high ROI","description":"Learn about lead generation pricing models, factors that influence costs, and how to maximize ROI. Compare top companies and align your budget with your goals.","image":["https:\u002F\u002Fimages.ctfassets.net\u002Fkyprwggh4muz\u002F71mwNcQYW7S68rxZVwTutp\u002F7a584f008e17f9c1abc069ef012a54e0\u002FCOVER__11_.webp"],"datePublished":"2026-06-22","dateModified":"2026-06-22","author":[{"@type":"Person","@id":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.artisan.co\u002Fauthors\u002Firina-maltseva#person","name":"Irina Maltseva","url":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.artisan.co\u002Fauthors\u002Firina-maltseva"}],"publisher":{"@id":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.artisan.co\u002F#organization"},"mainEntityOfPage":"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.artisan.co\u002Fblog\u002Flead-generation-pricing"}4:T42f,Most sales tools automate tasks. Ava owns the entire BDR job. She finds best-fit leads from a database of over 250 million B2B professionals across over 200 countries, plus Artisan Local Data with over 250 million local businesses, using intent signals like funding rounds, leadership hires, and website visits, then enriches them with verified emails and AI web research. She runs personalized campaigns across email and social outreach, continuously testing dozens of message variations and shifting volume toward what converts. Calling is built into the platform too: Ava auto-triggers call steps on engagement and dials them, then a rep takes the live conversation. She handles every reply against a knowledge base and books qualified meetings directly on reps' calendars. Ava Inbound extends the same platform to your website: live chat that greets and qualifies visitors, answers from the same knowledge base, and books meetings with CRM-owner routing, so inbound and outbound run on the same platform. Inbound and outbound both run on the same usage-based pricing.0:{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[[["$","script",null,{"id":"article-json-ld","type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],["$","script",null,{"id":"breadcrumb-json-ld","type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fschema.org\",\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"itemListElement\":[{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Home\",\"item\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fwww.artisan.co\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Blog\",\"item\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fwww.artisan.co\\u002Fblog\"},{\"@type\":\"ListItem\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"The ultimate guide to lead generation pricing for high ROI\",\"item\":\"https:\\u002F\\u002Fwww.artisan.co\\u002Fblog\\u002Flead-generation-pricing\"}]}"}}],["$","$L3",null,{"post":{"id":"2OYRHkSaikd1iO29FxWF2a","slug":"lead-generation-pricing","title":"The ultimate guide to lead generation pricing for high ROI","publishedDate":"2026-06-22","seoDescription":"Learn about lead generation pricing models, factors that influence costs, and how to maximize ROI. Compare top companies and align your budget with your goals.","readTime":"10 minutes","tag":"Sales","heroImage":{"url":"https://images.ctfassets.net/kyprwggh4muz/71mwNcQYW7S68rxZVwTutp/7a584f008e17f9c1abc069ef012a54e0/COVER__11_.webp","width":2909,"height":1365,"title":"COVER (11)"},"content":{"nodeType":"document","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Lead generation is a competitive market. But leads cost money, and measuring lead costs against budgets and ROI has become a science that salespeople should quickly master.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"This article discusses pricing your lead generation efforts, measuring key metrics, and planning them against your budget and business goals for a good ROI.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-2","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"4 Top Lead Generation Pricing Models","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Pricing your lead generation spend starts with understanding the different approaches used to assess the cost of generating those leads. Some of the most common models (cost per lead, cost per appointment) are dynamic and granular, providing a deeper understanding of your ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/blog/sales-acceleration-solutions"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"potential ROI","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":". Bulk lead purchasing and retainers, however, give you more control over costs and eliminate some of the swings that can come with other approaches.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"embedded-asset-block","data":{"target":{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"kyprwggh4muz"}},"id":"5Wg1IrX4pyeS8Bi2OIAylT","type":"Asset","createdAt":"2024-09-13T18:24:04.316Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-13T18:24:04.316Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":8,"revision":1,"locale":"en-US"},"fields":{"title":"Cost Per Lead","description":"The words \"Lead Generation Pricing Models\" above a square divided into four sections: content per lead (CPL), cost per acquisition (CPA), bulk data purchasing, and retainer. ","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/kyprwggh4muz/5Wg1IrX4pyeS8Bi2OIAylT/31f37b75648ba24e088b8272fd3e4816/Cost_Per_Lead.webp","details":{"size":98336,"image":{"width":1756,"height":1237}},"fileName":"Cost Per Lead.webp","contentType":"image/webp"}}}},"content":[]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"1. Cost Per Lead (CPL)","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The CPL model measures how much a buyer pays (in a fixed amount) for individual leads. Itâ€™s a good way to drill down into a per-lead view of ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/blog/post-event-marketing"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"costs and ROI","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":", with the understanding that what constitutes a â€œleadâ€ may change based on the channel or your specific sales pipeline.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The general equation used to calculate CPL is:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"embedded-asset-block","data":{"target":{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"kyprwggh4muz"}},"id":"6A00iVVtre98w7cTS0sOmV","type":"Asset","createdAt":"2024-09-13T18:25:20.946Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-13T18:25:20.946Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":6,"revision":1,"locale":"en-US"},"fields":{"title":"CPL","description":"The text \"CPL = Total Marketing Spend over Number of Leads.\" ","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/kyprwggh4muz/6A00iVVtre98w7cTS0sOmV/e4913bcf7a8740b0c990a624d4d510e6/CPL.webp","details":{"size":98900,"image":{"width":3314,"height":1001}},"fileName":"CPL.webp","contentType":"image/webp"}}}},"content":[]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"For example, if the total spend for lead generation campaigns is $4,000 and you pull 55 satisfactory leads, the CPL would be:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"$$4,000/55 = $72.72Â Â ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"CPL differs from similar metrics like Cost Per Click (CPC) or Cost Per Acquisition (CPA) in that CPL measures costs associated per lead, CPA measures costs related to obtaining new customers, and CPC measures expenses related to general engagement on social media or search advertising.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"2. Cost Per Acquisition (CPA)","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Much like CPL measures the costs for leads, CPA measures the costs for scheduled appointments. In this definition, an â€œappointmentâ€ is a bit more in-depth than a simple lead. Where a simple lead is just thatâ€“a lead gained from outreach or marketingâ€“an appointment suggests a one-on-one meeting with a qualified lead who meets the criteria of your Ideal Customer Profile (ICP).Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The equation is similar to CPL:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"embedded-asset-block","data":{"target":{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"kyprwggh4muz"}},"id":"5GJCaO6M9lWz2kPXdx0LY0","type":"Asset","createdAt":"2024-09-13T18:26:53.265Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-13T18:26:53.265Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":5,"revision":1,"locale":"en-US"},"fields":{"title":"CPA","description":"The words \"CPA = Total Marketing Spend over Number of Qualified Appointments\" ","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/kyprwggh4muz/5GJCaO6M9lWz2kPXdx0LY0/3b1d45ed29fb2c11d31d9da44856dbd0/CPA.webp","details":{"size":120414,"image":{"width":3826,"height":1001}},"fileName":"CPA.webp","contentType":"image/webp"}}}},"content":[]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"An appointment can be seen as a more valuable lead, and CPA measures these critical events. The overall costs might be higher and more complicated to predict, but these are much more advanced leads.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"3. Bulk Data Purchasing","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"As the name suggests, bulk data purchasing involves an organization buying one or several contact information databases and using that information for its sales pipeline.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Unlike CPL or CPA, bulk data purchasing is a direct approach to lead creationâ€“you arenâ€™t building marketing or sales ads to reach potential customers; youâ€™re just grabbing a ready-made pool of ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/blog/lead-qualification-checklist"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"potential leads","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" and using them to fuel outreach.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Typically, youâ€™ll purchase or gather this data through one of a few ways:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Buying the data in bulk from a data broker to ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/blog/crm-data-management"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"import into a CRM","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":".","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" This can include behavioral data and metrics from a service provider or anonymized metrics. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Tapping into public databases like government records","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":", social media profiles, and websites. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"First-party data gathering","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" through developing your databases and analytics.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Getting a handle on pricing here can be more difficult because how you pay for this data can change depending on the source and your needs.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"This approach is much more straightforward than finding external leads and provides a stable way to measure ongoing costs (since youâ€™ll most likely pay for the data upfront).Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"4. Retainer","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"If you donâ€™t want to handle your lead generation, you can outsource this function to a third-party sales or marketing outfit for a monthly retainer. Unlike a pay-per-lead model, a retainer gives you a stable monthly cost that you can count on, with the understanding that you donâ€™t have any control over how many leads you get or the quality of those leads.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"blockquote","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Maximize your lead research and budgeting with powerful automation and insights with our AI SDR, Ava. ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/ai-sales-agent"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Try Ava Now","marks":[{"type":"underline"}],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":".\n","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"heading-2","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Factors Influencing Lead Generation Pricing","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"A critical factor in how much leads cost (and the cost youâ€™re willing to accept) is where they come from. Industry, market, product, and location all significantly impact lead pricing. Depending on how these factors interact, ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/blog/lead-generation-outsourcing"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"lead generation","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" in one area or line of business can be much more costly than in other areas.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"embedded-asset-block","data":{"target":{"metadata":{"tags":[],"concepts":[]},"sys":{"space":{"sys":{"type":"Link","linkType":"Space","id":"kyprwggh4muz"}},"id":"7bgrZOxlm8L4FjosyVfia3","type":"Asset","createdAt":"2024-09-13T18:28:38.889Z","updatedAt":"2024-09-13T18:28:38.889Z","environment":{"sys":{"id":"master","type":"Link","linkType":"Environment"}},"publishedVersion":9,"revision":1,"locale":"en-US"},"fields":{"title":"Factors Influencing Lead Generation Pricing","description":"The words \"Lead Pricing Factors\" above six boxes with the following text inside: industry type, lead generation methodology, lead quality, geographic consideration, business overhead + operational costs, business profit. ","file":{"url":"//images.ctfassets.net/kyprwggh4muz/7bgrZOxlm8L4FjosyVfia3/aef65d88a07c07b43e0c8fe9593c562e/Factors_Influencing_Lead_Generation_Pricing.webp","details":{"size":133910,"image":{"width":2593,"height":1165}},"fileName":"Factors Influencing Lead Generation Pricing.webp","contentType":"image/webp"}}}},"content":[]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Your Industry Type","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Lead prices arenâ€™t stable across industries; lead prices will change to match these variations and the challenges that come with them. Accordingly, the cost of lead generation (even hiring lead generation companies) will vary.","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Some of the factors that will boost these costs (and the price you pay) include:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Competition for leads","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":", where higher competition can drive higher lead costs. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Complex sales cycles ","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":"related to different industry purchasing practices. For example, ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/blog/b2b-sales-tools"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"B2B tech sales","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":" will have a much more complex purchasing cycle than subscription-based ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/blog/saas-marketing"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"SaaS sales","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":". ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Company sizes,","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" especially if industries tend to have massive corporations rather than a network of small businesses.","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Regulations around data privacy","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" can limit the kinds of information you can get about prospects, making certain types of lead generation more expensive.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Lead Generation Methodology","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"The methods you use to generate leads can also empower or hinder your efforts. Your lead generation strategies can encompass the channels you use, your target audiences, and the techniques you use to attract leads.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Inbound marketing methods","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":", including ","marks":[],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"hyperlink","data":{"uri":"https://www.artisan.co/blog/digital-sales-funnel"},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"digital marketing","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"text","value":", content creation, Search Engine Optimization (SEO), and organic social media engagement, are cost-effective approaches for prospecting that donâ€™t require much direct engagement. However, most of these (especially content marketing and SEO) are also slow and unpredictable. ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Outbound prospecting","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"data":{}},{"nodeType":"text","value":" can include traditional approaches like cold calling and direct mail and digital tactics like cold email market