odeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Not all markets are equal, and this is especially true when considering a lead's location. Depending on the product or service you offer, certain areas will have much more competition (and, thus, higher costs per lead).Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Urban areas will often have higher levels of competition for products like technology or healthcare, for example. Likewise, different cities reflect more or less mature markets for certain services, making them harder to prospect than up-and-coming tech cities.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Following this logic, if you prospect for leads in competitive markets, your lead costs will often increase.Â ","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"heading-3","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Your Business Overhead and Operational Costs","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Other investments also play a role in your market spend, and these costs can become complex and amorphous. Costs like:","marks":[],"data":{}}]},{"nodeType":"unordered-list","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Salaries for salespeople","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Resources (offices, computers, utilities) used by these salespeople, andÂ ","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]},{"nodeType":"list-item","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"nodeType":"text","value":"Costs for the creative development of outbound sales or marketing assets (paying designers, licensing software, etc.)","marks":[],"data":{}}]}]}]},{"nodeType":"paragraph","data":{},"content":[{"